      {
        "number": 13,
        "internalPageId": 14,
        "title": "At home! Don’t you have a test tomorrow? Yes, mum. I start studying in some minutes. Tommy it is 8 o’clock, very late! Easy, mum! I finish reading this pages in some minutes and I get to it. If you don’t pass the test tomorrow, you will be grounded until you are married. I am going to pass mum not to worry. Hey BTW, do we have a family meeting tomorrow? Yes! Tomorrow, your grandma is on her birthday. Oh…! I want to hang out with my friends tomorrow night... Sorry, we have a family commitment, you are coming with us! Oh great! Another boring family meeting.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "At home! Don’t you have a test tomorrow? Yes, mum. I start studying in some minutes. Tommy it is 8 o’clock, very late! Easy, mum! I finish reading this pages in some minutes and I get to it. If you don’t pass the test tomorrow, you will be grounded until you are married. I am going to pass mum not to worry. Hey BTW, do we have a family meeting tomorrow? Yes! Tomorrow, your grandma is on her birthday. Oh…! I want to hang out with my friends tomorrow night... Sorry, we have a family commitment, you are coming with us! Oh great! Another boring family meeting.",
          "C. Read the following dialogue and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the dialogue with your teacher.",
          "1. He does not have a test tomorrow. (T) (F) 2. He starts studying in some minutes. (T) (F) 3. It is 10 PM. (T) (F) 4. He is reading. (T) (F) 5. He will be grounded until he is married, if does not pass. (T) (F)",
          "6. They have a family meeting tomorrow night. (T) (F) 7. He is not hanging out with friends. (T) (F) 8. He is happy for attending the family meeting. (T) (F)"
        ],
        "links": [],
        "media": [
